 "text": "Hey, good to have you here. How are you? Immersion matters a lot. Spend few weeks completely in the language, talking, reading and thinking in it. You'll absorb plenty. A well structured course is your friend. It shows you which words you need know and how they connect. Start with something short and well written in the language you' learning. It gives you confidence. They' worth hunting for. Whichever you choose, read aloud the story to yourself each night. It's lovely way to practice pronunciation.",
